# Optional API Keys for Last.fm and BetterLyrics
# AI Studio automatically injects these at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure these via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
# Uncomment the lines below if you configure Last.fm or BetterLyrics API keys:
# LASTFM_API_KEY=YOUR_LASTFM_API_KEY
# LASTFM_SECRET=YOUR_LASTFM_SECRET
# BETTERLYRICS_API_KEY=YOUR_BETTERLYRICS_API_KEY